<title>ESTONIA: PORT OF TALLINN TO ISSUE THREE-MONTH CPS.</title>
<headline>PORT OF TALLINN TO ISSUE THREE-MONTH CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The port of Tallinn will issue 20 million kroons of three-month commercial papers on July 14, Hansapank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The commercial papers will yield seven percent, Hansapank's interest rates product manager Ulo Kallas told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
